OL,3,GNEWSAGrant helps mental health group
OL,4,Ameet demand
OL,5,
OL,6,FA #50,000 grant to support a mental
OL,7,Fhealth service will help it to "remain
OL,8,Fsafe, consistent and sustainable", a
OL,9,Fcharity co-founder has said.
OL,11,FThe money, awarded from the
OL,12,Fgovernment's dormant assets fund, will
OL,13,Fbe used to expand the peer-support
OL,14,Fservices offered by Ed Space by funding
OL,15,Ftwo full-time positions for the next
OL,16,Fyear.
OL,18,FShirley Cain, who co-founded the
OL,19,Fcharity after her brother, Eddie Joyce,
OL,20,Ftook his own life, said it would help
OL,21,Fthe group keep up with demand.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
